# Copied to /etc/default/myotherapp-backup (optional): overrides for the
# backup units in ops/backup/systemd. Everything here has a default.
# (ops/server/setup.sh and ops/server/ops-bot/install.sh write it on the
# Oracle box: MOA_PROJECT_DIR=/srv/moa, MOA_COMPOSE_FILE=compose.yml. The
# Telegram delivery and alerts find the bot at $MOA_PROJECT_DIR/ops-bot; its
# own settings are in /srv/moa/env/ops-bot.env, not here.)

# The checkout docker-compose runs from.
#MOA_PROJECT_DIR=/var/www/myotherapp-production
# The compose file and the backend's service in it (staging: docker-compose.yml).
#MOA_COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.prod.yml
#MOA_SERVICE=backend
# What the monthly drill is given. Staging: --standalone. Production:
# --max-age-hours 26 alone (compares with the live database, read-only).
#MOA_DRILL_ARGS=--standalone --max-age-hours 26
